#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.isin.isin:1 of
msgid "Return a boolean LiteFrame showing whether each element is in *values*."
msgstr "返回一个布尔 LiteFrame，表示每个元素是否存在于 *values* 中。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.isin.isin:0 of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.isin.isin:3 of
msgid ""
"If an iterable, the same membership test is applied to every column.  If "
"a dict, ``{column_name: values}`` applies a per-column membership test; "
"columns not present in the dict are all ``False``."
msgstr ""
"如果是可迭代对象，则对每一列应用相同的成员测试。如果是字典，``{column_"
"name: values}`` 会对每一列应用各自的成员测试；字典中不存在的列全部为 ``"
"False``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.isin.isin:0 of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.isin.isin:8 of
msgid "Boolean LiteFrame with the same shape (visible columns only)."
msgstr "形状相同的布尔 LiteFrame（仅包含可见列）。"

